cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Vorlagen für den EU AI Act
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as part of the SimpleAct AI Governance Framework."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: SimpleAct-Compliance
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimpleAct-Compliance/simpleact-ai-act-templates"
license: MIT
abstract: "Templates for Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 treated as a system rather than a folder: one source per field, with every other template referencing it instead of copying the value. Holds the three templates for obligations already applicable — the Art. 5 practice screen, the Art. 4 training record and the Art. 50 labelling record — plus an evidence register with four states, a field dictionary with naming conventions, and the four queries that surface contradictions between registers."
keywords:
  - EU AI Act
  - GDPR
  - compliance templates
  - field dictionary
  - evidence register
  - Article 5
  - Article 4
  - Article 50
  - AI governance
  - SimpleAct
